{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02486","headline":"奉和禁苑饯别应令 · 褚亮","name":"奉和禁苑饯别应令","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大藩初锡瑞，出牧迩皇京。\n暂以绿车重，言承朱传荣。\n舒桃临远骑，垂柳映京营。\n惠化宣千里，威风动百城。\n禁籞芳嘉节，神襟饯送情。\n金笳催别景，玉琯切离声。\n野花开更落，山鸟哢还惊。\n微臣夙多幸，薄宦奉储明。\n钓台慙作赋，伊水滥闻笙。\n怀德良知久，酬恩识命轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}